codex
Per-case timings show the 128-channel nomask path is already mostly the batched contraction at large N, while C=384 cases pay more in the projection/norm stages. I’m profiling representative small, medium, and large cases to separate kernel-launch overhead from tensor-core work and memory layout costs.
