codex
I’m trying one larger fusion for C=128: compute input layernorm and the 5-way projection in a single Triton kernel. This saves the normalized activation write/read and the cuBLAS projection launch, but it has to compete with cuBLAS tensor-core efficiency, so I’ll benchmark it before keeping it.
